      "author": "@江田島平八-w2j",
      "authorImage": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_nVAGrARpSSxNnrqQ5428JKLPwCX5FHis5H9yKW3t2w=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj",
      "text": "オーストラリアではヨーロッパ車は故障だらけかな。",
